        "The nearby locker is sealed, but the [clue.key]key hangs outside it[/clue.key]. You need not force anything open. You can spend [clue.key]one more step collecting the key and returning to the hall[/clue.key], or [clue.key]leave it in place and return for free[/clue.key].",
